# Lines to MERGE into CovertCook/public/_headers (Netlify). Do not copy blindly: read TP step A12.

# 1) In the existing global Content-Security-Policy, add 'wasm-unsafe-eval' to script-src:
#    script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval';
#    (allows compiling WebAssembly only; it does NOT allow eval() of JavaScript strings)

# 2) Cross-origin isolation ONLY on the ML pages (multi-threaded WASM needs SharedArrayBuffer).
#    On the whole site it could break third-party resources (images, Supabase).
/lab/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

/scan
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# 3) Models and runtime: long cache, names are versioned
/models/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/ort/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
